                    91.0,
                    490.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Based on the writers' verbal intelligence, prior knowledge, and essay scores, their essays were analyzed for structure and evaluated for richness of concepts. The subjects were then separated into high- or low-ability groups. Half of each group was randomly assigned to a treatment group or to a placebo group.",
            "block_bbox": [
                104,
